<view class="page {{theme === 'dark' ? 'theme-dark' : ''}}">

  <view class="panel-card about-hero">
    <view class="about-logo">🌿</view>
    <view class="about-name">{{appName}}</view>
    <view class="about-version">版本 {{version}}</view>
    <view class="about-desc">{{appDesc}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel-card">
    <view class="section-title">✨ 能做什么</view>
    <view class="feat-row" wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="feat-icon">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="feat-text">
        <view class="feat-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="feat-sub">{{item.sub}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel-card">
    <view class="section-title">❓ 常见问题</view>
    <block wx:for="{{faqs}}" wx:key="q" wx:for-index="idx">
      <view class="faq-q" data-idx="{{idx}}" bindtap="toggleFaq">
        <text>{{item.q}}</text>
        <text class="faq-arrow">{{activeIndex === idx ? '−' : '＋'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{activeIndex === idx}}" class="faq-a">{{item.a}}</view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="panel-card">
    <view class="section-title">💬 帮助与反馈</view>
    <button class="action-btn" open-type="contact">
      联系客服 / 提建议
      <text class="sub">遇到问题或有想法，可以直接留言</text>
    </button>
    <view class="action-btn" bindtap="copyInfo">
      复制版本信息
      <text class="sub">反馈问题时附上，方便定位</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-foot">
    经期预测基于历史记录推算，仅供参考，不构成医疗诊断或建议。
    本小程序不获取头像、昵称等个人信息。
  </view>

</view>
